# Load path for editors; the build itself goes through rocq/Makefile, which
# passes the same -Q flag.  This file has to sit at the repository root rather
# than next to the sources: Rocq 8.20's VsRocq server reads a project file once
# at startup, searching upward from its working directory (the workspace root),
# and ignores per-document ones.  GeoCoq comes from COQPATH, which the dev
# shell sets, so the editor has to be launched from `nix develop`.
-Q rocq/Ender Ender
